              <documentation>Subscribe to Corporate Policy Specification notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Product &amp; Services Direction" id="ad8b5a6c-410e-409d-8265-aa72697a59a7">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Product &amp; Services Direction" id="ca2b4343-fcfd-4b95-b618-ec79f179120e">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Senior product and service management assess performance and define the policies governing product and service delivery

General comment:
This service domain consolidates the senior management function of assessing and directing product and service strategies and defining policies governing product and service delivery. These policies are subordinate to the corporate/enterprise policies

Business Purpose
:  Develop and communicate product and service policies and adapt in response to changing needs and to practical experience




Пример использования:
Высшее руководство по продуктам и услугам оценивает производительность и определяет политику, регулирующую поставку продуктов и услуг

Общее замечание:
Эта сфера услуг объединяет функции высшего руководства по оценке и руководству стратегиями в области продуктов и услуг и определению политики, регулирующей предоставление продуктов и услуг. Эти политики подчиняются корпоративным / корпоративным политикам

деловая цель
: Разработка и распространение политики в отношении продуктов и услуг и адаптация с учетом меняющихся потребностей и практического опыта
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateProducts" id="58e58caf-4f2e-4714-87a8-4cb34573ba9b">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Products &amp; Services Strategy</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" configureProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="e369c7be-3c53-4c96-a29c-f959e0d593d8">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Products &amp; Services Strategy</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="authorizeProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="80b7bd30-1e3c-46f8-815f-74b0dd7e93d6">
              <documentation>Obtain authorization for some action under the Products &amp; Services Strategy</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" recordProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="8643f612-1007-4be0-be9e-a30962738e1d">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Products &amp; Services Strategy</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" requestProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="ab2dd5af-3ef5-4db5-8f15-96422e6723db">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Products &amp; Services Strategy </documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" notifyProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="f823e511-02f9-457c-bb55-0c0cf374063c">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Products &amp; Services Strategy notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" retrieveProducts&amp;ServicesStrategy" id="0c4aef7f-7584-4e5f-8e10-99593c7848cf">
              <documentation>Retrieve Products &amp; Services Strategy related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Business Architecture" id="2aab42bb-5067-4646-a177-a589983f382f">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Business Architecture" id="336f56ac-c413-4154-9fb3-05f70b8f5254">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Specialist business architects define the target state business architecture and migration/ transition goals and plans

General comment:
This service domain handles the specification and maintenance of the enterprise business architecture. This reflects the business priorities set out in the corporate strategy and the organization as defined in the organizational model. It provides a basis for defining performance goals and budgets and can be a high level blueprint for systems and operational implementation (The BIAN model supports this activity directly)

Business Purpose
:  Develop and maintain a business architecture conforming to the corporate strategy and plan and operational configuration of the enterprise




Пример использования:
Специалисты по бизнес-архитекторам определяют целевую государственную бизнес-архитектуру и цели и планы миграции/ перехода

Общее замечание:
Этот домен служб отвечает за спецификацию и обслуживание корпоративной бизнес-архитектуры. Это отражает бизнес-приоритеты, изложенные в корпоративной стратегии и организации, как определено в организационной модели. Он обеспечивает основу для определения целей и бюджетов производительности и может быть высокоуровневой схемой для систем и операционной реализации (модель BIAN поддерживает эту деятельность напрямую)

деловая цель
: Разработка и поддержка бизнес-архитектуры, соответствующей корпоративной стратегии, плану и операционной конфигурации предприятия
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="createBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="27660716-c7d1-443f-9cf6-5ca26d681e14">
              <documentation>Create/register a Business Architecture Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="8d8e8096-0bba-4e69-9ef2-4a4aaa05e0ed">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Business Architecture Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="4d8ec488-2739-464d-8617-a52fac890311">
              <documentation>Request access to a Business Architecture Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="03d02a25-fcbf-4336-98d2-b892c63ecd3f">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Business Architecture Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="65e9b347-4429-4858-9e73-9b1b7a659362">
              <documentation>Update elements of the Business Architecture Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="22eb35ed-9029-48e2-998f-57d86429686b">
              <documentation>Retrieve Business Architecture Specification related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyBusinessArchitectureSpecification" id="b2dc40d6-2316-4c5d-8b0f-d12b16fad11f">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Business Architecture Specification notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Continuity Planning" id="6e08e3af-d99e-4851-b2b1-943331f982ec">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Continuity Planning" id="ade85bb9-de41-4ba7-ae62-601ded287a6e">
              <documentation>Example of use:
A business continuity plan is developed for key business activities and assurance tests performed

General comment:
This service domain administers the development and maintenance of continuity facilities and plans. This includes determining and arranging for redundant capabilities where necessary, the definition and periodic testing of contingency plans and recovery procedures and organizational structures

Business Purpose
:  Develop, maintain and test continuity plans and supporting facilities for an appropriate range of possible failure scenarios






Пример использования:
План непрерывности бизнеса разработан для ключевых бизнес-мероприятий и проведенных тестов обеспечения

Общее замечание:
Этот домен обслуживает развитие и поддержание непрерывности услуг и планов. Это включает в себя определения и организации резервные ресурсы в случае необходимости, определение и периодическое тестирование планов и процедур восстановления и организационных структур

деловая цель
: Разработка, поддержка и тестирование планов непрерывности и вспомогательных средств для соответствующего диапазона возможных сценариев отказов

</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="02ec9a26-3ff2-4bb8-86ce-6c751473aa20">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="332bc2f0-4b12-4638-932d-79c00a402dfe">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="600209dd-0bd4-4e5c-967f-3ce98e1e2307">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="93588648-9799-473e-bf85-6cf63aa75557">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="0ce475bf-3d66-4ce5-9388-7e7e4c40b82f">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="55aaddee-75a0-49b7-a5d6-2e628366be31">
              <documentation>Retrieve Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyEnterpriseContinuityAssuranceManagementPlan" id="8eecc6b6-f12b-492d-826b-b6f7b7c1ff8f">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Enterprise Continuity Assurance Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
        </folder>
        <folder name="Corporate Relations" id="1941d5aa-e34b-4eb9-824d-4fa46155728e">
          <folder name="Corporate Communications" id="62c9eaab-9606-4777-bac7-8c955e2716df">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Corporate Communications" id="5e043c66-8121-44fa-a08a-c506dec6d9c0">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Press releases are developed to coincide with financial performance reporting

General comment:
This service domain handles the external communications to external agencies, alliances and the general population, typically in response to major decisions or events that involve the enterprise. This include regular notifications such as quarterly performance and ad-hoc events such as after a major disruption or change in the corporation set-up

Business Purpose
:  Develop and distribute key corporate messages as needed to support the strategy and maintain the enterprise reputation and brand



Пример использования:
Пресс-релизы разрабатываются одновременно с финансовой отчетностью

Общее замечание:
Эта область обслуживания обрабатывает внешние связи с внешними учреждениями, альянсами и населением в целом, как правило, в ответ на основные решения или события, связанные с предприятием. Это включает регулярные уведомления, такие как ежеквартальная производительность и специальные события, такие как после серьезного сбоя или изменения в настройке корпорации

деловая цель
: Разработка и распространение ключевых корпоративных сообщений, необходимых для поддержки стратегии и поддержания репутации и бренда предприятия
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="d0456309-bc82-4836-9ae7-24ce74827b90">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Enterprise Communication Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="8d329801-8223-480e-9044-b4850ac3b6f4">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Enterprise Communication Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="b330d106-f83b-48c0-9e6f-8c2def802ef9">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Enterprise Communication Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="e0d6b0fd-4de4-4ffc-b256-e930e4cc93db">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Enterprise Communication Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="f10e517b-6e66-4fbb-b070-1f92bd74b6d5">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Enterprise Communication Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="99d0c271-cdd6-4ed4-8abe-22a5faeb2a35">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Enterprise Communication Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveEnterpriseCommunicationManagementPlan" id="bf01e2b9-7c3f-4f99-9087-a9411632d47f">
              <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Enterprise Communication Management Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Corporate Alliance/Stakeholder" id="f2c24c69-2935-4df6-9af3-5b93ec489d54">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Corporate Alliance/Stakeholder" id="10db3fa4-c221-4455-8193-a8e017bc5890">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Corporate strategy is communicated and aligned with a product alliance partner

General comment:
This service domain handles the relationship activities for key alliance partners and stake holders in the enterprise. This includes activity to maintain strategic alignment, to inform and to develop key business relationships

Business Purpose
:  Manage key alliance and stake holder relationship - define tasks needed to develop and maintain contact and ensure relevant information is shared as appropriate



Пример использования:
Корпоративная стратегия сообщается и согласовывается с партнером по альянсу продуктов

Общее замечание:
Этот домен занимается деятельностью отношения для ключевых партнеров и заинтересованных сторон на предприятии. Это включает в себя деятельность по поддержанию стратегической согласованности, информированию и развитию ключевых деловых отношений

деловая цель
:: Управление ключевыми отношениями альянса и заинтересованных сторон-определение задач, необходимых для развития и поддержания контактов, и обеспечение обмена соответствующей информацией по мере необходимости
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="e19842f7-0539-44c1-80e4-0a46939575ce">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="5a5f1cd4-7869-41e5-9428-ea89fa8e3f84">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="5cff5975-2895-4555-80c6-f696fec41f55">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="8433d7ba-e729-4292-8b15-d5bf772c81dc">
              <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="dcfbb38d-0089-407f-8a8e-eab16c7bc7f9">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="86f728f4-6cfe-4b2b-839b-89a6d4166613">
              <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyAlliancePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="bcb3ec0d-f6c7-4c1a-b57a-3bcf11b0d846">
              <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Alliance Partner Relationship Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Corporate Relationship" id="011af6c2-9b77-4fdd-bd62-51bc78976e4c">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Corporate Relationship" id="69fecd10-8811-4ce9-a9fd-95476543161d">
              <documentation>Example of use:
A regular relationship review is scheduled with a major multinational customer to develop business opportunities

General comment:
This service domain handles the relationship activities with key corporate relationships, where the scale of business is a key influence to the performance or viability of the enterprise

Business Purpose
:  Manage corporate relationships with key parties such as major clients, political and industry groups, user associations etc.


Пример использования:
Регулярный обзор отношения с крупной международной поддержки для развития бизнеса 

Общее замечание:
Этот домен обслуживания обрабатывает действия отношений с ключевыми корпоративными отношениями, где масштаб бизнеса является ключевым влиянием на производительность или жизнеспособность предприятия

деловая цель
 Управление корпоративных отношений с ключевыми участниками, такими как крупные клиенты, политических и промышленных групп, ассоциаций потребителей и т. д.</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="54d4648c-d274-4175-bd8e-49d67660681d">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="6fd45542-4865-4c51-9022-4bc7b7a556b1">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="813ed88e-49b8-4304-bc16-d97a1361771f">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="72267a0b-5c5e-4879-ab30-e2535bb2b110">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="f1b2299d-82bc-440c-9e28-18d74445b110">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="226cfe05-c3f3-416b-9d41-e27a5e07a704">
              <documentation>Retrieve Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyCorporatePartnerRelationshipManagementPlan" id="be1cedaa-4d09-47ed-ab86-d2415a6f5478">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Corporate Partner Relationship Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Regulatory and Legal Authority" id="81a71893-5e5f-4906-b19c-5bc730b3b850">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Regulatory and Legal Authority" id="2a8df416-9ea6-4fb7-834c-9719cb747ca3">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Senior finance directors liaise with regulators over a significant regulatory decision or assessment

General comment:
This service domain handles the relationship with regulatory and legal authorities. This includes overseeing the regular and ad-hoc reporting activity handled by the service domain Regulatory Compliance as well as the relationship based activities of information sharing and major project or transaction discussions where legal or regulatory approval and guidance is needed

Business Purpose
:  Maintain effective relations with regulators, accounting and government agencies. Oversee interactions and reporting as necessary




Пример использования:
Старшие финансовые директора поддерживают связь с регулирующими органами по вопросам принятия важных регуляторных решений или оценки

Общее замечание:
Этот домен обслуживания регулирует отношения с регулирующими и правовыми органами. Это включает в себя надзор за регулярной и специальной отчетной деятельностью, обрабатываемой нормативным соответствием домена услуг, а также за деятельностью по обмену информацией на основе отношений и обсуждениями крупных проектов или транзакций, где требуется юридическое или нормативное одобрение и руководство

деловая цель
: Поддержание эффективных отношений с регуляторами, бухгалтерскими и государственными органами. Надзор за взаимодействием и отчетность по мере необходимости
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="c47afa32-0f5b-4bdb-aee3-b2e1ff2935ce">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="3d37031c-f3f4-4d60-bb1e-3836da8cb1f6">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="6696cf34-af1b-4bf9-bb6e-24a04c573de9">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="cb4db970-c77f-4a62-8b48-248589258ded">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" terminateRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="5643ef20-37f2-41ce-ab7a-68afa4928e5d">
              <documentation>Comment:

Terminate all or some part of the Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="344350d1-76ac-4451-856e-5aa6f17a523e">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveRegulatory&amp;LegalAuthorityRelationshipManagementPlan" id="e42c2bde-7022-49eb-8609-207e8abedc6c">
              <documentation>Retrieve Regulatory &amp; Legal Authority Relationship Management Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Investor Relations" id="148e1190-ac19-4128-a8b5-53630f043c2c">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Investor Relations" id="e6eacdf5-ecdc-4252-9cec-58bff113b427">
              <documentation>Example of use:
Investor presentation is organized to present the annual report

General comment:
This service domain handles the administration of investor membership details and the range of communications and events needed to support investor communications, in particular the publications and distribution of the annual report and hosting investor publications, forums and meetings

Business Purpose
:  Maintain investor relations, publish annual reports, interim statement and host investor meetings as necessary and appropriate



Пример использования:
Презентация инвестора организована для представления годового отчета

Общее замечание:
Этот домен услуг отвечает за администрирование сведений о членстве инвесторов и спектр коммуникаций и мероприятий, необходимых для поддержки коммуникаций с инвесторами, в частности за публикации и распространение годового отчета и размещение публикаций, форумов и совещаний инвесторов

деловая цель
: Поддерживать отношения с инвесторами, публиковать годовые отчеты, промежуточные отчеты и проводить собрания инвесторов по мере необходимости и необходимости
</documentation>
            </element>
