            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureHelpDeskOperatingSession" id="bd6bebea-c7a0-41c8-a2b4-c602e3f29333">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Help Desk Operating Session</documentation>
