            <folder name="Cash Management &amp; Account Services" id="4ac2b06d-2d6b-40ce-a0fe-185ebf46a3f5">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Cash Management &amp; Account Services" id="cd8f8dd1-bd79-4ed1-a2c9-9de0f6ba586f">
                <documentation>Example of use:

A corporate customer's cash management services are fulfilled

General comment:

This service domain covers a broad range of possible products and services that are bundled under the general term cash management. The service domain is a place holder as the various cash management products and services will be supported by a range of fulfillment service domains when this area is fully developed

Business Purpose
:  Orchestrate the range of Cash Management services available for Corporates (includes cash handling, account reconciliation, cash concentration, ACH, Positive and Reverse Positive Pay, Sweep and Wire services)






Пример использования:

Осуществляется расчетно-кассовое обслуживание корпоративного клиента

Общее замечание:

Эта область обслуживания охватывает широкий спектр возможных продуктов и услуг, которые объединены под общим термином управление денежными средствами. Домен обслуживания является заполнителем, поскольку различные продукты и услуги по управлению денежными средствами будут поддерживаться рядом доменов обслуживания выполнения, когда эта область будет полностью разработана

деловая цель
: Организовать комплекс услуг по управлению денежной наличности для юридических лиц (включает в себя обработку наличных денег, сверка расчетов, клиринг, АКП, положительные и обратные позитивные платить, развертки и телеграфных служб)

 
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="11f56621-98be-4f28-8ab1-c434d52471ef">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Cash Management Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="44040d55-1493-4287-84df-26aedbb0902e">
                <documentation>Initiate Cash Management Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="70aaee70-9f58-4341-8a55-85f40d0806da">
                <documentation>Retrieve Cash Management Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="63361366-ff82-4769-86b8-d5807ec65658">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the Cash Management</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="e90d51fd-0338-4de6-b7fd-cfbafe4dce91">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Cash Management</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="cba11ee4-a2a5-49d2-8df3-30ff60b1c275">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Cash Management</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="30ed4803-05a4-4aa9-901c-901323e976c4">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Cash Management</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateCashManagementFulfillmentArrangement" id="a01213ad-2e7d-43a6-bde8-0e51b5f4ccea">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Cash Management</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Direct Debit Mandate " id="16587fca-9b99-484c-90e8-791b03d374ad">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Direct Debit Mandate " id="f02cb2d3-db33-484a-ad2e-3735020eb668">
                <documentation>Example of use:

A customer completes a direct debit mandate for a corporate client

General comment:

The direct debit mandates for all customers are maintained as they relate to a direct debit facility handed for a corporate client.

Business Purpose
:  Manage the customer mandates associated with a direct debit processing facility for a corporate client






Пример использования:

Клиент завершает мандат прямого дебетования для корпоративного клиента

Общее замечание:

Мандаты прямого дебетования для всех клиентов сохраняются, поскольку они относятся к механизму прямого дебетования, переданному корпоративному клиенту.

деловая цель
: Управление мандатами клиента, связанными со средством обработки прямого дебетования для корпоративного клиента

Service Domain - Direct Debit Mandate
Customer mandates are administered/managed that are associated with a direct debit processing facility provided for a corporate client. The individual customer mandates are registered and may be updated/amended. The mandates are referenced to confirm coverage when direct debit processing is undertaken periodically

Executive Summary
This service domains manages the customer mandates associated with direct debit processing for a corporate client

Examples Of Use
A customer completes a direct debit mandate for a corporate client that is registered

</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="892d9c5a-d7b6-47f4-9677-2f5a488732c8">
                <documentation>Comment:

Initiate Direct Debit Mandate Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="67dee336-f721-4f36-8206-3aa0657726a9">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the Direct Debit Mandate</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="52dacf20-780f-4740-bd1a-7fbca7bf53c0">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Direct Debit Mandate</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="a9cd32e0-f51e-417c-a267-5ccc2e873757">
                <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Direct Debit Mandate</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="5bff13f0-6f54-402d-b0a7-718fade7b1bb">
                <documentation>Comment:

Terminate all or some part of the Direct Debit Mandate</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="382975e5-5f98-42a0-9be2-ea34a69b2563">
                <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Direct Debit Mandate Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="fe6b7767-1c0f-4e83-aebf-3047271dd37c">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Direct Debit Mandate</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyDirectDebitMandateFulfillmentArrangement" id="2b2d07f3-5b7e-4d32-bf48-31432a811467">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Direct Debit Mandate Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Direct Debit " id="7071abd9-79f8-4e4f-b84d-d202cd3d7403">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Direct Debit " id="9cfb6df8-2504-4d3b-a8ce-ac374a4d3433">
                <documentation> Example of use:
A (business) customer issues a direct debit to collect monthly fees from its (consumer) customers. 

General comment:

A direct debit consists of one credit and multiple debits. Typically, the debits are executed individually, as the accounts debited are with multiple banks. Direct Debit keeps track of this, with the position delegated to Position Keeping. The debtor side of the direct debit is handled by Payment Order (and Payment Execution).

Business Purpose
:  Fulfils a direct debit agreement. Handles the creditor side of direct debits.

Documentation
 Process the direct debit payments for a corporate client




Пример использования:
(Деловой) вопросы поддержки прямого дебета сбор ежемесячных платежей от клиентов (потребителей). 

Общее замечание:

Прямое дебетование состоит из одного кредита и нескольких дебетов. Как правило, дебетование выполняется индивидуально, так как дебетованные счета находятся в нескольких банках. Прямое дебетование отслеживает это, а позиция делегируется для хранения позиции. Дебиторская сторона прямого дебетования обрабатывается платежным поручением (и исполнением платежа).

деловая цель
: Выполняет соглашение о прямом дебете. Обрабатывает кредиторскую сторону прямого дебета.

Документация
 Обработка платежей прямого дебетования для корпоративного клиента
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="231ddaf3-9294-4eb7-b4a4-d3fc823dd322">
                <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Direct Debit Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="5b2f7947-5256-4257-86d2-36b61215b391">
                <documentation>Initiate Direct Debit Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="a2ad00b5-3fc1-4eb4-a4e0-37a4c1ad211b">
                <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Direct Debit Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="6ef8a0f0-bd96-45f1-8858-d3c12c8e48d7">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the Direct Debit</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="c0b0c194-2660-491b-8fe1-eb868869bd8f">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Direct Debit</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="c653409b-edea-4a6f-a19a-ee83afcad745">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Direct Debit</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="3a443df4-552e-4383-a5be-766093182845">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Direct Debit</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateDirectDebitFulfillmentArrangement" id="4a3235d4-adb6-4108-a796-033fee1d334a">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Direct Debit</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Cheque Lock Box" id="3167c28e-48f5-44a4-8adf-473fbc5afe2a">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Cheque Lock Box" id="ca097966-2888-42a8-8a99-c7cc2516db8e">
                <documentation>Example of use:

A batch of checks are processed for a corporate customer with a lock box payment facility

General comment:

This service domain covers lock box services. These could be considered to fall under the general collection of cash management products and services. It has been developed as a stand alone capability in advance of other cash management services as it relates to consumer activity where the BIAN service landscape is generally more developed

Business Purpose
:  Consolidation of retail checks for a corporation (could be classified as another Cash Management service)



Пример использования:

Пакет чеков обрабатывается для корпоративного клиента с возможностью оплаты в сейфе

Общее замечание:

Эта услуга охватывает окне Службы замка. Они могут быть отнесены к общей коллекции управления денежными продуктов и услуг. Он был разработан в качестве самостоятельной возможности в преддверии других услуг по управлению денежными средствами, поскольку он относится к потребительской деятельности, где ландшафт услуг BIAN, как правило, более развит

деловая цель
: Консолидация розничных чеков для корпорации (может быть классифицирована как другая служба управления денежными средствами)
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="50b97fe2-1817-44ec-88a8-c9be022091f4">
                <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Lock Box Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="a36d5b8a-533b-4fb5-9324-a85d397b58ea">
                <documentation>Comment:

Initiate Lock Box Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="5dc625ea-7725-4f21-8d7c-e861fe8e2951">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the Lock Box</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="241598cb-04be-4e3c-ad71-42e031d8acfc">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Lock Box</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="a6418dfe-7484-496e-af8c-5b5aa952ab5f">
                <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Lock Box</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="34fa4e86-1248-4a64-b1a6-6b06752fb8d1">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Lock Box</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="aa1869bc-bd10-4de9-89a2-4c5417f1e4ea">
                <documentation>Comment:

Update elements of the Lock Box</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveLockBoxFulfillmentArrangement" id="e6f0f9cd-adaf-49ae-a9e4-5430bc6a84fa">
                <documentation>Retrieve Lock Box Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Factoring" id="778f36fe-9e3d-4288-9b71-c744caa0bfef">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Factoring" id="12e91020-304e-4781-914d-c1ebc242aff6">
                <documentation>Example of use:

The Bank buys (factors) a batch of customer invoices to provide short term liquidity

General comment:

This service domain supports the provision of factoring services to corporate customers. It covers the transfer of the accounts to the bank. Additional functionality may be required to process factored transactions for the bank to recover its costs

Business Purpose
:  Factoring services allows for a bank to buy a customers sell accounts receivable at discount to provide advanced income to improve short term liquidity



Пример использования:

Банк покупает (факторизует) партию клиентских счетов для обеспечения краткосрочной ликвидности

Общее замечание:

Данный домен услуг поддерживает предоставление факторинговых услуг корпоративным клиентам. Она охватывает перевод счетов в банк. Для обработки факторизованных транзакций банку может потребоваться дополнительная функциональность для возмещения своих расходов

деловая цель
: Факторинговые услуги позволяют банку покупать клиентам продавать дебиторскую задолженность со скидкой, чтобы обеспечить авансовый доход для улучшения краткосрочной ликвидности
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="014ffcd0-ff67-4367-b07e-9b47f0542c2d">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Factoring Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="24800cc1-6e94-466f-ab3e-96f636dd157b">
                <documentation>Initiate Factoring Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="1362dda7-f2a1-475e-a4fc-eb10f18cca81">
                <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Factoring Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="8549ea6c-584e-4c61-a459-2198cfa9bd76">
                <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Factoring</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="0a89bca4-8371-4331-baa3-cd212360635f">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Factoring</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestFactoringFulfillmentArrangement" id="9727e04a-1a84-4b5f-b59d-6fcb00d76768">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Factoring</documentation>
              </element>
