Initiate a Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestMarketOrderTransaction" id="b264d12f-1f19-45f5-a740-bbc30339881e">
                <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateMarketOrderTransaction" id="ab7aa478-7e7c-47c5-99df-fdf0bd72c314">
                <documentation>Comment:

Update elements of the Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyMarketOrderTransaction" id="41c33bea-bee2-4c23-a7ca-6b412a1f88eb">
                <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Market Order Transaction notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveMarketOrderTransaction" id="813c5651-21cb-4abb-aa4c-77ca483b64ca">
                <documentation>Retrieve Market Order Transaction related reports</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Market Order Execution" id="ae670320-2c7b-4385-a147-33bfea84e8f6">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Market Order Execution" id="572d4d75-39eb-4806-b3ee-3d4a294ea308">
                <documentation>Example of use:

An order is placed to off-load a large quantity of a security. The order is completed in a number of market trades

General comment:

The capability captures and executes orders in the wholesale market, where an order constitutes a series of trades typically to unload a position. Market Order Execution initiates trade execution and determines the subsequent allocation of trades and pricing to the order

Business Purpose
:  Orchestrate the completion of market orders from the trading perspective





Пример использования:

Заказ размещен для разгрузки большого количества ценных бумаг. Ордер исполняется в ряде рыночных сделок

Общее замечание:

Возможность захватывает и выполняет заказы на оптовом рынке, где заказ представляет собой серию сделок, как правило, для выгрузки позиции. Market Order Execution инициирует исполнение сделки и определяет последующее распределение сделок и ценообразование на ордер

деловая цель
: Организовывать выполнение рыночных ордеров с точки зрения торговли
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateMarketOrderTransaction" id="1b0fc1bd-37dc-432c-82ac-bf185cc5a6dc">
                <documentation>Initiate a Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeMarketOrderTransaction" id="42b48b18-0c61-4189-ba26-8bff8ec76ef8">
                <documentation>Execute a task against the active Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestMarketOrderTransaction" id="4b51f236-1094-4a86-b2ee-18a15d33c8e4">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateMarketOrderTransaction" id="445a9b00-a3df-4529-8b87-861e55eaaa02">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Market Order Transaction</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyMarketOrderTransaction" id="19ae2ae5-907b-4ccf-a284-bca737fc051e">
