                <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Credit/Charge Card</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" executeCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangementBilling" id="73ab00d0-190f-4140-b5b2-e5fd6a08b568">
                <documentation>Execute automated billing action for an arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangementTransaction" id="5f1aeadd-d4ba-4072-a662-abb48338edc5">
                <documentation>Execute card transaction against the facility</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" recordCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangement" id="7a5c48e8-786a-432a-8211-11821382a6ad">
                <documentation> Record activity/feedback against a credit/charge card arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" updateCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangement" id="9d65c1f8-94d8-4b6e-9428-67f2f0e3ea9f">
                <documentation> Update details of an active credit/charge card arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangement" id="ab899e90-0ff0-43eb-b5be-b529b6337773">
                <documentation> Request a credit/charge account service</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateCredit/ChargeCardFulfillmentArrangement" id="4f6b49b6-4f11-4d53-b482-849b4977445f">
                <documentation>Termination request for a credit/charge card arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Card Authorization / Авторизация карты" id="f0c00b5d-b585-4c23-91c5-9817780589da">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Card Authorization" id="7885c4e8-aaef-4a09-8104-f527820169cb">
                <documentation>Example of use:

A credit card customer makes a large purchase, the card authorization triggers a verbal check of the customer details for security and the authorization is given

General comment:

This service domain is responsible for the real time card authorization decisions for credit/charge cards. The authorization decision is automated and can be extremely complex. Transactions may be passed for manual checks by on-line service representatives for out of pattern purchases. Note that authorized transaction amounts may vary from the actual final amount (e.g. pre authorized hotel/car hire and charged meals excluding tips) and in cases there will be no financial transaction for an authorized transaction if the customer chooses to pay using a different card/cash

Business Purpose
:  Execute the decision based authorization and recording of proposed card transactions through the merchant network








Пример использования:

Клиент кредитной карты совершает крупную покупку, авторизация карты запускает устную проверку данных клиента на безопасность и авторизация дается

Общее замечание:

Этот сервисный домен отвечает за принятие решений об авторизации кредитной/платежной карты в режиме реального времени. Решение об авторизации автоматизировано и может быть чрезвычайно сложным. Сделки могут быть переданы для ручной проверки представителями онлайн-сервиса для внеплановых покупок. Обратите внимание, что сумма авторизованной транзакции может отличаться от фактической окончательной суммы (например, предварительно авторизованный отель / прокат автомобилей и оплаченное питание, за исключением чаевых) , и в случаях, когда для санкционированной транзакции не будет финансовой транзакции, если клиент решит оплатить с помощью другой карты / наличными

деловая цель
: Выполнить авторизацию на основе решения и регистрацию предлагаемых операций по карте через торговую сеть


Service Domain - Card Authorization
The proposed card transaction is requested by a merchant and routed through the Acquirer and Card Network to the Issuer. The authorization decision is automated and can be extremely complex. Transactions may be passed for manual checks by on-line service representatives for out of pattern purchases. Note that authorized transaction amounts may vary from the actual final amount (e.g. pre authorized hotel/car hire and charged meals excluding tips) and in cases there will be no financial transaction for an authorized transaction if the customer chooses to pay using a different card/cash. While this function is primarily performed by the Issuer, Acquirers and Card Networks may perform Stand-in Authorization and forward the results to the Issuer for recording.

Executive Summary
This service domain is responsible for the real time card authorization decisions for credit/charge cards.

Examples Of Use
A credit card customer makes a large purchase, the card authorization triggers a verbal check of the customer details for security and the authorization is given
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" activateCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="76c6101c-06a3-4090-ade4-e7db5a6a7758">
                <documentation>Comment:

Activate the Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment service</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="62e9811f-fe7e-4dbc-9adc-fc75f3a6f821">
                <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment service</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" authorizeCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="3f722605-e13d-4192-8191-37c3063c81b8">
                <documentation>Obtain authorization for some action under the Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="evaluateCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="7cc1d71d-60e4-4e22-a118-8e38daf1a24c">
                <documentation>Check/verify compliance with Credit/Charge Card Authorization related checks/assessments</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" recordCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="c531ced2-62e6-4dc0-b1e2-9e076b72081d">
                <documentation>Comment:

Record activity details/information against an ongoing Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment evaluation</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="d14ea7c0-bfe5-4593-b92c-14b7a7c2b284">
                <documentation> Comment:

Request service under Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" retrieveCredit/ChargeCardAuthorizationAssessment" id="abed5802-1bdc-4a77-9729-a3353f06f0c8">
                <documentation>Retrieve Credit/Charge Card Authorization Assessment related reports</documentation>
