                <documentation>Request a service under the Customer Tax Obligation</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateCustomerTaxObligationFulfillmentArrangement" id="523557e5-1e37-4bc0-bbd6-5d4e2801c206">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Customer Tax Obligation</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveCustomerTaxObligationFulfillmentArrangement" id="8e29d160-20c3-49c5-afed-c93509cf5885">
                <documentation>Retrieve Customer Tax Obligation Product Agreement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateCustomerTaxObligationFulfillmentArrangement" id="d80fad2c-823e-43c3-8459-6b4f4c0b5fa2">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Customer Tax Obligation</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyCustomerTaxObligationFulfillmentArrangement" id="cb29aad5-8103-44df-b499-cdbd90afb6ff">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Customer Tax Obligation Product Agreement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Consumer Advisory Services" id="6ba09abc-f60c-4abd-b055-c605f955561b">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Consumer Advisory Services" id="19f66d15-ee73-4cb5-8b77-1f1204186b88">
                <documentation> Example of use:
Select products which are eligible to meet the needs of a customer

General comment:
This service center governs the delivery and charging for financial advice that may be provided to a consumer customer. In some jurisdictions there are strict regulatory requirements on the allowed advice and terms

Business Purpose
:  Provide consumer financial advice






Пример использования:
Выберите продукты, которые соответствуют требованиям клиента

Общее замечание:
Этот сервисный центр регулирует доставку и взимание платы за финансовые консультации, которые могут быть предоставлены потребителю. В некоторых юрисдикциях существуют строгие нормативные требования к разрешенным советам и условиям

деловая цель
: Предоставление финансовых консультаций потребителям
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateConsumerAdviceFulfillmentArrangement" id="5f00e966-9730-42e4-b551-3bb7ec831b42">
                <documentation> Initiate a consumer advice fulfillment arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeConsumerAdviceFulfillmentArrangement" id="8e3c98aa-8e91-4344-8244-2edd90ef7aff">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the consumer advice fulfillment arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
