Retrieve Mergers &amp; Acquisition Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" notifyMergers&amp;AcquisitionFulfillmentArrangement" id="acad32b1-5896-4182-b601-216c56b89125">
                <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Mergers &amp; Acquisition Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" initiateMergers&amp;AcquisitionFulfillmentArrangement" id="006daf24-e8f9-4e8a-87e3-eb9e1ade873f">
                <documentation>Initiate Mergers &amp; Acquisition Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" executeMergers&amp;AcquisitionFulfillmentArrangement" id="6e182ffe-32ac-4cf7-a4f7-f167e8b87ec0">
                <documentation>Comment:

