                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Mergers &amp; Acquisition</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" requestMergers&amp;AcquisitionFulfillmentArrangement" id="be2cc737-44e2-4fb2-9429-f3530a5ab10d">
                <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Mergers &amp; Acquisition</documentation>
