            <folder name="Corporate Tax Advisory" id="ccf8f6c1-9e96-4525-b7f8-9ec197e90dd7">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Corporate Tax Advisory" id="5d25bb42-78dd-4493-95e4-6c9b6b548a23">
                <documentation>Example of use:

A corporate client engages the bank to optimize its tax position at the end of the tax year

General comment:

This service domain handles a fee based advisory service to support tax advice and optimization for corporate clients, including international tax liability distribution and booking optimization services. Note that many products and services will include aspects of tax administration and reporting within their overall fulfillment capabilities. Note also that there is a specific service domain to handle aspects of cross product needs for customers such as withholding tax calculations

Business Purpose
:  A fee or commission based project providing tax specific advice, typically for corporate customers.



Пример использования:

Корпоративный клиент привлекает банк к оптимизации налоговой позиции по итогам налогового года

Общее замечание:

Этот сервисный домен предоставляет платные консультационные услуги по налоговым консультациям и оптимизации для корпоративных клиентов, включая международное распределение налоговых обязательств и услуги по оптимизации бронирования. Обратите внимание, что многие продукты и услуги будут включать аспекты налогового администрирования и отчетности в рамках их общих возможностей выполнения. Обратите внимание, что существует определенный домен услуг для обработки аспектов потребностей клиентов в перекрестных продуктах, таких как расчеты подоходного налога

деловая цель
: Платный или комиссионный проект, предоставляющий налоговые консультации, как правило, для корпоративных клиентов.
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="b043adcb-8973-4e80-b2e8-b96dfd6910ed">
                <documentation>Initiate Corporate Tax Advisory Services Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="429666b2-c31a-4559-8d01-9748c96b2420">
                <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Corporate Tax Advisory Services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="34c5bc67-52cd-4cb6-8147-924922164f8d">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Corporate Tax Advisory Services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="e81c70d9-d2f2-4a1f-bd8f-dc91feff207c">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Corporate Tax Advisory Services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="8e913569-3ad1-45ec-8fe7-33b703d345fd">
                <documentation>Comment:

Terminate all or some part of the Corporate Tax Advisory Services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="7ad9c753-8214-4ee3-8b59-56577035f195">
                <documentation>Retrieve Corporate Tax Advisory Services Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="53564721-afe8-44ad-846e-9e5f10bb6dc1">
                <documentation>Update elements of the Corporate Tax Advisory Services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyCorporateTaxAdvisoryServicesFulfillmentArrangement" id="f22448c4-c70c-40d1-9853-74844263441b">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Corporate Tax Advisory Services Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Public Offering" id="05b58bda-bdcc-4f59-b812-51453aa920fd">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Public Offering" id="ea6e7e13-21c7-4416-a208-82075cffeefe">
                <documentation>Example of use:

Corporate finance services provide support to a corporation that has determined to make a public offering to raise funds.

General comment:

This service domain handles the process for assembling, pricing, compliance/legal/regulatory assurance and reporting, underwriting and executing a public offering for a corporation (for both IPO/LBO and subsequent corporate financing activities)

Business Purpose
:  Project coordination and execution/ placement of a public offering of corporate equity or debt



Пример использования:

Службы корпоративных финансов оказывают поддержку корпорации, которая решила сделать публичное предложение о привлечении средств.

Общее замечание:

Этот домен услуг обрабатывает процесс сборки, ценообразования, соблюдения / правовой / нормативной гарантии и отчетности, андеррайтинга и выполнения публичного предложения для корпорации (как для IPO / LBO, так и для последующей деятельности по корпоративному финансированию)

деловая цель
: Координация проекта и проведение / размещение публичного предложения корпоративного капитала или долга
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiatePublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="42da3054-99a3-4321-836f-db7d3509b57f">
                <documentation>Comment:

Initiate Public Offering Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executePublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="d064f10d-9a66-4bfe-8d44-5ddfc5c6b97d">
                <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Public Offering</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="8b4857c4-ce1d-4f7d-9093-a494dcf8dc60">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Public Offering</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestPublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="0464c792-7f44-4a9b-ba3a-224372ee9f5b">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Public Offering</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminatePublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="a81550fe-ecd5-4f4a-9b0d-b0558e00c8b9">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Public Offering</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyPublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="5b4772b3-b02e-47a8-93c0-02ee570cef6d">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Public Offering Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updatePublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="ec7d84b6-a550-46a6-9346-977539ec64be">
                <documentation>Comment:

Update elements of the Public Offering</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrievePublicOfferingFulfillmentArrangement" id="f3cd5462-45b3-428d-96d1-cb8c8305cbd8">
                <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Public Offering Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Private Placement" id="c317692a-7fdb-44b2-957e-60b9162328a7">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Private Placement" id="7c65b1e6-576b-4cc0-b9cc-bf196984a086">
                <documentation>Example of use:

Corporate finance services provide support to a corporation that has determined to raise funds through a private placement.

General comment:

This service domain handles the less regulatory intensive private placement activity for corporate/project financing as offered as a service by investment banks with access to suitable investors and investment organizations

Business Purpose
:  Project coordination and execution/ placement of a private offering of corporate equity or debt (avoids regulatory constraints of Public Placement)



Пример использования:

Корпоративные финансовые услуги предоставляют поддержку корпорации, которая решила привлечь средства через частное размещение.

Общее замечание:

Эта область услуг обеспечивает менее регулятивную деятельность по размещению частных инвестиций для корпоративного / проектного финансирования, как это предлагается в качестве услуги инвестиционными банками с доступом к подходящим инвесторам и инвестиционным организациям

деловая цель
: Координация проекта и проведение / размещение частного предложения корпоративного капитала или долга (избегает регулятивных ограничений публичного размещения)
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiatePrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="64da9f69-0812-4e5e-b363-81d174ca5c1f">
                <documentation>Initiate Private Placement Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executePrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="1834a7c8-c504-4b01-a0b0-0de73ed451d3">
                <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Private Placement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="ae31463d-d066-4ed1-87d7-4bff9bf591b4">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Private Placement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestPrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="b7a4f1c5-ab49-4825-8cd4-2a69054e9233">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Private Placement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminatePrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="4c82c8e7-01f4-4ea3-bfb1-e22f3e89cb47">
                <documentation>Comment:

Terminate all or some part of the Private Placement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrievePrivatePlacementFulfillmentArrangement" id="bf5a73d3-6d2c-48d5-a538-9242c039c815">
                <documentation>Retrieve Private Placement Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
