                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Managed Investment Portfolio Analysis</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestManagedInvestmentPortfolioAnalysis" id="41736da8-471c-4165-95a2-9bbc3bb545d1">
                <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the Managed Investment Portfolio Analysis</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyManagedInvestmentPortfolioAnalysis" id="759d3848-ebb6-47ff-9628-753e2fc7fa9e">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Managed Investment Portfolio Analysis notification services</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveManagedInvestmentPortfolioAnalysis" id="9da4669a-bda0-4b7e-a2e1-c49d3325c66e">
                <documentation>Retrieve Managed Investment Portfolio Analysis related reports</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Investment Portfolio Management" id="ae3accef-f060-4f4d-91a3-612d8a0766b6">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Investment Portfolio Management" id="b21350f0-f37f-407c-a8b1-086775d08b1e">
                <documentation>Example of use:

Investment managers track the markets and initiate trades to re-align and optimize the client portfolio in line with the investment agreement/ charter

General comment:

An ongoing trading activity to initiate trading of securities within the customer investment portfolio to take advantage of market conditions, remaining within the agreed investment policies governing the portfolio

Business Purpose
:  Orchestrate the investment/ rebalancing of an investment portfolio to optimize gains remaining within the terms of the portfolio 'charter' or agreement





Пример использования:

Инвестиционные менеджеры отслеживают рынки и начинают торговлю для приведения и оптимизации клиентского портфеля в соответствие с инвестиционным соглашением / уставом

Общее замечание:

Текущая торговая деятельность по инициированию торговли ценными бумагами в рамках инвестиционного портфеля клиента для использования рыночных условий, оставаясь в рамках согласованной инвестиционной политики, регулирующей портфель

деловая цель
: Организовывать инвестиции / перебалансировку инвестиционного портфеля для оптимизации прибыли, оставшейся в рамках &quot;устава&quot; портфеля или соглашения
</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="initiateManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="54932b53-0a72-4ba5-b822-8f18b11487b4">
                <documentation>Comment:

Initiate Managed Investment Portfolio Product Arrangement</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="f5b950df-d3d8-41ad-b3f1-4c5b05d3d324">
                <documentation>Execute a task under the Managed Investment Portfolio</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="9ad57ed1-e554-45aa-b79c-0ec296af2ff9">
                <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Managed Investment Portfolio</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="fc56653f-56bc-47d2-9f28-dccc55ff2731">
                <documentation>Request a service under the Managed Investment Portfolio</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="58db009d-9097-4c60-b8af-78def8cb0663">
                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Managed Investment Portfolio</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="4e65973d-3dd5-49ef-b994-bcaad265733a">
                <documentation>Retrieve Managed Investment Portfolio Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateManagedInvestmentPortfolioFulfillmentArrangement" id="925f8bb9-35ae-42fa-994a-c726b1e38e65">
