                <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Corporate Current Account</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveCorporateCurrentAccountFulfillmentArrangement" id="82edfbe1-1e15-4f0c-bfd6-8aa0da9c84b7">
                <documentation>Retrieve Corporate Current Account Product Arrangement related reports</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateCorporateCurrentAccountFulfillmentArrangement" id="0e53f9a9-6e56-4e6d-9737-3bf28de109ac">
                <documentation>Comment:

Update elements of the Corporate Current Account</documentation>
              </element>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyCorporateCurrentAccountFulfillmentArrangement" id="5c3160cd-011c-474e-9cc5-502d50b78942">
                <documentation>Subscribe to Corporate Current Account Product Arrangement notification services</documentation>
              </element>
            </folder>
            <folder name="Consumer Loan / Потребительский кредит" id="25455d99-874b-4705-b941-800edd02000a">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Consumer Loan" id="a8750cc4-2cfc-4da5-9a64-a6a009d2159b">
                <documentation>Example of use:
A consumer customer applies for and gets a loan to purchase new furniture.

General comment:

Business Purpose
:  Fulfillment of a range of loan products for consumer clients





Пример использования:
Потребитель подает заявку и получает кредит на приобретение новой мебели.

Общее замечание:

деловая цель
: Выполнение ряда кредитных продуктов для розничных клиентов


Service Domain - Consumer Loan
The consumer loan product may include different properties/features depending on a bank's preferences and policies. The loan is targeted at consumer customer and may be associated with a type of product and may or may not be secured by collateral.

Detailed Summary
This service domain handles the fulfillment of a consumer loan product. This includes the initial set-up of the loan facility and the completion of scheduled and ad-hoc product processing tasks.

Executive Summary
This service domain handles the fulfillment of a consumer loan product. This includes the initial set-up of the loan facility and the completion of scheduled and ad-hoc product processing tasks.

Examples Of Use
A consumer customer applies for and gets a loan to purchase new furniture.

</documentation>
