            <folder name="Collateral Asset Administration" id="74a9afc1-2869-405d-9afc-6562e6045213">
              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Collateral Asset Administration" id="0a5273f9-cc7f-4e9a-aa20-fc098bdf301d">
                <documentation>Example of use:
A back office unit determines which collateral items are due for a valuation review and documentation check and schedules the activities accordingly

General comment:
This service domain handles the oversight, administration and confirmation of tasks associated with certain collateral items. This includes arranging for scheduled and ad-hoc collateral valuations, item status/documentation and title checks and tracking of maintenance activities that the item owner is obliged to undertake (such as insuring a house)

Business Purpose
:  Maintain the status of a collateral item, include scheduled and ad-hoc valuation and confirmation of the correct completion of scheduled maintenance tasks.




Пример использования:
Подразделение бэк-офиса определяет, какие предметы обеспечения подлежат оценке и проверке документации, и планирует соответствующие мероприятия

Общее замечание:
Этот домен услуг отвечает за надзор,администрирование и подтверждение задач, связанных с определенными сопутствующими элементами. Это включает в себя организацию запланированных и специальных оценок залога, проверки статуса/документации и права собственности на предмет и отслеживание мероприятий по техническому обслуживанию, которые владелец предмета обязан предпринять (например, страхование дома)

деловая цель
: Поддержание статуса предмета обеспечения, включая плановую и специальную оценку и подтверждение правильного выполнения задач планового технического обслуживания.

Service Domain - Collateral Asset Administration
This service domain handles the oversight, administration and confirmation of maintenance tasks associated with different types of collateral items. This includes arranging for scheduled and ad-hoc collateral valuations, item status/documentation and title checks and tracking upkeep actions that the item owner is obliged to undertake (such as insuring a house)

Detailed Summary
This service domain maintains the status of a customers collateral assets, including scheduled and ad-hoc valuations and confirmation of the correct completion of scheduled maintenance tasks.

Executive Summary
This service domain maintains the status of a customers collateral assets, including scheduled and ad-hoc valuations and confirmation of the correct completion of scheduled maintenance tasks.

Examples Of Use
A back office unit determines which collateral items are due for a valuation review and documentation check and schedules the activities accordingly</documentation>
              </element>
