              <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Global Standard Specification related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Location Data Management" id="e9bbde8f-f44f-4001-8e45-822eb362f41e">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Location Data Management" id="380ce907-dc35-495a-ba31-019070b8556c">
              <documentation>Example of use:

Maintain the layout and use of a shopping center that is referenced for on-line marketing

General comment:

The maintenance of location details is used to support more dynamic sales and servicing activities enabled by mobile devices and tracking. At a basic level validity checks are provided, but more interactive uses can also be supported

Business Purpose
:  Maintain details of the use and state of locations of interest (e.g. shops)








ЯндексПереводчик

Пример использования:

Ведение макета и использование торгового центра, на который ссылается интернет-маркетинг

Общее замечание:

Обслуживание сведений о местоположении используется для поддержки более динамичных операций продаж и обслуживания с помощью мобильных устройств и отслеживания. На базовом уровне предусмотрены проверки валидности, но могут поддерживаться и более интерактивные применения

деловая цель
: Сохранение сведений об использовании и состоянии интересующих объектов (например, магазинов)

Service Domain - Location Data Management
The maintenance of location details is used to check the validity, allowed use and occupancy of locations - both physical and virtual. This information can be augmented using external directory services when appropriate. The information is used for authentication and security purposes, and can also be used for interactive location based sales and marketing when combined with location tracking services/capabilities


Executive Summary
This service domain maintains details of the use and state of locations of interest to the bank. This can include both physical and virtual addresses. It is used to check for valid use and for sales/marketing activities

Examples Of Use
A new prospect provides an address as their place of residence. It is checked to be a valid/known location for residential use.



</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateLocationDirectory" id="3100be85-da45-4799-9c01-ff297888cd6a">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the location directory</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureLocationDirectory" id="1b0473c8-f4e9-4625-abd1-06589b3ba452">
              <documentation> Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the location directory</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordLocationDirectory" id="c17e2d47-da09-4247-bd1f-6c28ca272398">
              <documentation> Record usage or feedback against a location directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="registerLocationDirectory" id="0580d603-da02-4a39-9f08-fee66842ab0d">
              <documentation>Register a new location directory entry (reference/usage details)</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestLocationDirectory" id="fa748f28-10e5-4aa1-9c75-f3b280d5c382">
              <documentation> Request a check/refresh of a location directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyLocationDirectory" id="6e3b1a84-b8af-42ac-bbff-b7f6c33bc937">
              <documentation>Comment:

Subscribe to Location Enrollment notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateLocationDirectory" id="83bbd6f7-0619-4c07-bc6b-be56c92f9eae">
              <documentation> Update an existing location directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveLocationDirectory" id="3c521bfb-dabb-4b40-89ba-8b712f2e1467">
              <documentation> Retrieve a location directory record/report</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
        </folder>
        <folder name="Party" id="b9adbfed-2951-4d6b-8364-1a21c11f3512">
          <folder name="Party Data Management" id="1f32d0e6-c5fd-4273-8e7a-799522df79b1">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Party Data Management" id="ac8f72fb-4cb1-415d-afa7-631b6f77bed4">
              <documentation>Example of use:

Party legal entity details are obtained for selection in an internal sales campaign

General comment:

This service domain maintains a comprehensive set of party reference information. This has significantly different content and functionality depending on party/customer type. The main reference information is legal entity structure. It is possible that additional party type specific reference service domains will be added in later versions of the model (for example reference details specific to customer types, brokers, agents, counterparties, sub-custodians etc.)

Business Purpose
:  Maintain a comprehensive set of party reference details, including legal entity structure, demographics, administrative, KYC related properties, status and activity summaries





Пример использования:

Сведения о юридическом лице стороны получены для выбора во внутренней кампании продаж

Общее замечание:

Этот домен сохраняет полный набор справочной информации. Это имеет значительно различное содержание и функциональность в зависимости от типа партии/клиента. Основная справочная информация-структура юридического лица. Возможно, что в более поздних версиях модели будут добавлены дополнительные Домены справочной службы для конкретных типов сторон (например, справочные сведения, относящиеся к типам клиентов, брокерам, агентам, контрагентам, суб-кастодианам и т. д.).)

деловая цель
: Поддерживать полный набор группа реквизитов, в том числе юридическое лицо структуры, демографии, административного, ЗСК свойства, состояния и активности резюме



Service Domain - Party Data Management
This service domain maintains a view of the legal entity structure of a party with which the bank does business. It records different reference information detail depending on the type of entity - e.g. an individual/household, company or business partner. Where appropriate the service domain can maintain ratings and key financial properties of the entity where this has a bearing on the bank relationship.

Detailed Summary
This service domain maintains details of the legal entity structure of the party including dependents and associations for individuals and ownership/subsidiary structures for corporations. Some financial indicators and product coverage/activity details can be included where this defines the nature of the legal entity relationship in particular for corporate entities.

Executive Summary
This service domain maintains details of the legal entity structure of the party including dependents and associations for individuals and ownership/subsidiary structures for corporations.

Examples Of Use
Party legal entity details are checked for the financial booking of a major loan.



</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyPartyDirectory" id="bc54c6a8-3a0d-4d1a-b0c5-b2c70a0a5abb">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Party Registration notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activatePartyDirectory" id="e16d450a-3209-4346-8e99-216f2c9b0e0c">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the party directory</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configurePartyDirectory" id="d9635bf7-0810-4e43-b37b-578263681a13">
              <documentation> Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the party directory</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPartyDirectory" id="89dc2dbb-4050-48d5-99b8-baa0a7f459a1">
              <documentation>Record usage or feedback against a directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="registerPartyDirectory" id="c1e3867c-aa1a-49e4-8111-84b8655a224f">
              <documentation>Register a new Party </documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="registerPartyDirectoryPartyAssociation" id="97684c53-9c1c-40f0-bc68-c26136ce2828">
              <documentation> Register a new party association within the directory</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updatePartyDirectory" id="5d55924d-b3b2-4fdf-8221-ff520fa28b2d">
              <documentation>Update an existing party directory reference entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="registerPartyDirectoryPartyReference" id="4cd98275-200e-46c1-a284-9113abdd8a29">
              <documentation>Register a new party directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrievePartyDirectory" id="e70457c1-e70b-4629-b2f5-76bd43fb0c13">
              <documentation>Retrieve a party directory record/report</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestPartyDirectory" id="f1f68f20-ad61-4e09-be25-3336f2817138">
              <documentation>Request to refresh an existing party directory entry</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name=" Party associations/ownership" id="dd726621-1901-4517-b906-3a9290838f74"/>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="Party reference details" id="06a0be6a-dc60-4e81-bea9-081549742f9f"/>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Customer Profile" id="51642067-8dd0-414d-b264-1678a4f06fe5">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Customer Profile" id="8942b435-a50e-40c2-bc1a-1304098ed833">
              <documentation>Example of use:

The identity and active status of a customer is checked as they present themselves on-line to access their bank account

General comment:

The role of this service domain will be ratified in later versions of the landscape

Business Purpose
:  Maintain a small amount of current customer status data to identify and influence any real-time operational interaction for sales, servicing and/or fulfillment (e.g. high value, eligible for campaign, account suspended, open Case)



Пример использования:

Личность и активный статус клиента проверяется, как они представляют себя в интернете, чтобы получить доступ к своему банковскому счету

Общее замечание:

Роль этого домена услуг будет утверждена в более поздних версиях ландшафта

деловая цель
: Поддерживать небольшой объем текущих данных о состоянии клиентов, чтобы идентифицировать и влиять на любое оперативное взаимодействие в режиме реального времени для продаж, обслуживания и/или выполнения (например, высокая стоимость, право на кампанию, приостановленный счет, открытое дело)

Service Domain - Customer Profile
The customer profile service domain is used to tune the customer experience during any real-time interaction with the bank. A collection of status indicators, ratings and alerts can be maintained that are then used to influence the routing and servicing decisions that govern the customer interaction. For example a status indicator could include a warning that the account is in distress which would limit sales activity and might result in routing a contact to a specialist account recovery servicing facility

Detailed Summary
This service domain maintains a small profile of key indicators for a customer that is referenced during customer interactions to facilitate routing, servicing and product/service fulfillment decisions. This can include status (such as account in arrears), ratings (such as high value customer) and alerts (such possible fraud activity detected)

Executive Summary
This service domain maintains a small profile of key indicators for a customer that is referenced during customer interactions to facilitate routing, servicing and product/service fulfillment decisions. This can include status, ratings and alerts

Examples Of Use
The identity and active status of a customer is checked as they present themselves on-line to access their bank account</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activatePartyMeasurement" id="a40e95e0-2cff-4732-bff4-8b8ddcad87e8">
              <documentation>Comment:

Assign responsibility for and activate the Party Measurement</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configurePartyMeasurement" id="03af0223-9cf8-43c5-ba40-1b8ed4d057f4">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Party Measurement</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPartyMeasurement" id="0386ceea-fbcc-4658-bd94-4113cb500897">
              <documentation>Comment:

Record activity details/information against the Party Measurement</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPartyMeasurementCustomerAlert" id="4d3ceb2e-64c4-4f68-9750-2b09707662f9">
              <documentation>Record details about alerts relating to the party</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyPartyMeasurement" id="5b9f500a-0159-43c8-af95-c591fdadd1a6">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Party Measurement notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPartyMeasurementCustomerRating" id="03dd2752-756a-41a8-a80e-079904e36fe3">
              <documentation>Record details about ratings for the party</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestPartyMeasurement" id="4493f297-c109-4927-ae0e-a53cab99f8fa">
              <documentation> Request that the party status/profile is checked/refreshed</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordPartyMeasurementCustomerState" id="2982fcaa-59be-4fab-832a-3241a6e2e106">
              <documentation> Record details about the status of the party relationship</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrievePartyMeasurement" id="6e306053-c3ae-4808-96f1-7dc62c6d3c31">
              <documentation>Retrieve party measurement/status report</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminatePartyMeasurement" id="3f784cb5-9c16-487d-92f6-976032be440e">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Party Measurement</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="Customer flags/alert capture" id="51bd0641-fa0f-4172-96da-febc7cc5561f"/>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="Customer rating/indicator capture" id="7d3d3d55-5b1c-4607-a4f8-b4edc2a86b68"/>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="Customer state capture" id="350904af-07ee-4b7f-829e-435d06b4e376"/>
          </folder>
        </folder>
        <folder name="Product Management" id="e9c5299d-d737-472f-914e-829efa972430">
          <folder name="Product Design" id="dc32c677-3a6a-48b8-a9ad-931fa69a620e">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Product Design" id="35c23b73-5e47-4a90-8e79-45c7c52c052f">
              <documentation>Example of use:

A loans officer running through the offer process obtains the pricing details, disclosures, eligibility requirements and document handling needs for a loan product in order to process the offer

General comment:

Product design covers the creation/import and maintenance of a wide range of product specifications, including the execution and operational characteristics, supporting pricing, sales, regulatory and disclosure requirements. Some banks will include sophisticated product design capabilities that will constantly develop and tune the product specifications

Business Purpose
:  Develop/refine product designs and supporting specification details







Пример использования:

Сотрудник по кредитам, выполняющий процесс предложения, получает сведения о ценах, раскрытии информации, требованиях к приемлемости и обработке документов для кредитного продукта для обработки предложения

Общее замечание:

Дизайн продукта охватывает создание / импорт и обслуживание широкого спектра спецификаций продукта, включая исполнительные и эксплуатационные характеристики, поддержку ценообразования, продаж, нормативных требований и требований к раскрытию информации. Некоторые банки будут включать в себя сложные возможности дизайна продукта, которые будут постоянно развиваться и настраивать характеристики продукта

деловая цель
: Разработка / уточнение дизайна изделий и вспомогательных спецификаций</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" retrieveProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="959ffa00-488b-4941-913f-15d6cabed331">
              <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve Product/Service Specification related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" createProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="96d60f9f-b0be-4760-8752-e31a6e4eb251">
              <documentation>Comment:

Create/register a Product/Service Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="a3204096-5f36-409f-9761-1147f02bcd59">
              <documentation>Record activity/usage details/information against the Product/Service Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="22fe25de-ee40-4af6-8e08-64524ee999f1">
              <documentation>Request access to a Product/Service Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" terminateProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="06d0d6d1-030d-459d-ab03-d3046469b166">
              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Product/Service Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" updateProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="180908d5-663e-4981-b275-1e0ff2775f21">
              <documentation>Comment:

Update elements of the Product/Service Specification</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyProduct/ServiceSpecification" id="9f683343-412d-40ce-9648-722fac919b41">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Product/Service Specification notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Product Deployment" id="23f1d649-abad-4a5a-b988-99bf5089e9b3">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Product Deployment" id="15519ec9-4ec9-406c-9ad6-30bd21c34d6f">
              <documentation>Example of use:

A significant regulatory change mandates a revision of the terms of an existing product. An amended version is developed and the corresponding customer notification, internal training and production rollout is coordinated

General comment:

This is specific to the production acceptance, conversion, training and cutover for new and updated products and services. Note some banks will define and refine their own products, with highly specific features and pricing structures. The rollout time or 'time to money' for new and amended products is a key performance metric for banks active in highly competitive markets

Business Purpose
:  Plan and administer the deployment activities for new and enhanced products, includes training, inventory and solution deployment and coordination with operations, servicing, marketing and sales activities






Пример использования:

Значительное изменение в законодательстве требует пересмотра условий существующего продукта. Разрабатывается измененная версия и координируется соответствующее уведомление клиента, внутреннее обучение и развертывание производства

Общее замечание:

Это специфически к принятию продукции, преобразованию, тренировке и cutover для новых и обновленных продуктов и обслуживаний. Обратите внимание, некоторые банки будут определять и совершенствовать свои продукты, с весьма специфическими особенностями и ценовой структуры. Время развертывания времени или денег для новых и измененных продуктов является ключевым показателем эффективности для банков, действующих на высококонкурентных рынках

деловая цель
: Планирование и администрирование мероприятий по развертыванию новых и усовершенствованных продуктов, включая обучение, инвентаризацию и развертывание решений, а также координацию с операциями, обслуживанием, маркетингом и продажами</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name=" createProduct/ServiceDeploymentProject" id="95590ffb-c6ee-466c-933b-6a80a7905910">
              <documentation>Create a Product/Service Development Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordProduct/ServiceDeploymentProject" id="6212d0f8-1a1c-4144-83bf-3e7f59d4b87a">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Product/Service Development Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestProduct/ServiceDeploymentProject" id="80e86913-9429-4504-8f6d-d0e546b4baee">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Product/Service Development Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveProduct/ServiceDeploymentProject" id="6559385c-7d58-49f8-9e2c-883b5d52ac1d">
              <documentation>Retrieve Product/Service Development Plan related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Product Training" id="3c34a75a-3043-4bfb-8f44-784f9d25f8a6">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Product Training" id="fa5d71b7-0800-4ec3-9db4-f0c4e4d211cd">
              <documentation>Example of use:

New recruits to the call center are provided with service support training for some more specialized products

General comment:

This is a general service to provide ongoing and ad-hoc training to the workforce for product and service specific activities. Some media based self-help tuition could be made available to customers when appropriate

Business Purpose
:  Develop and provide product specific training across the workforce. This includes all media and training mechanisms (on-line, self taught, classroom etc.)




Пример использования:

Новобранцам в call-центр предоставляется обучение сервисной поддержке для более специализированных продуктов

Общее замечание:

Это общее обслуживание для обеспечения постоянной и специальной подготовки персонала по конкретным видам деятельности, связанным с продуктами и услугами. Некоторые средства массовой информации на основе Самопомощи обучение может быть доступна для клиентов, когда это необходимо

деловая цель
: Разработка и обеспечение специального обучения персонала. Это относится ко всем СМИ и механизмы обучения (он-лайн, самоучка, классе и т. д.)</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateProductTrainingProcedure" id="4638005c-f058-4a79-9eb4-9bc16b857093">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Product Training Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureProductTrainingProcedure" id="bdcacc80-37a9-4ee9-b094-05c0841248ac">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Product Training Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="executeProductTrainingProcedure" id="6f1c0e14-9497-4978-bef2-496c9207ca88">
              <documentation>Comment:

Execute a task under the Product Training Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordProductTrainingProcedure" id="f55afbb0-04ff-4ea8-93c5-c50bdc7b05d9">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the Product Training Procedure </documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestProductTrainingProcedure" id="384709bc-51fc-49e8-b74e-ffca1cd7c989">
              <documentation>Request a service under the Product Training Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveProductTrainingProcedure" id="5485bc52-9972-4cef-9dc5-469313568efe">
              <documentation>Retrieve Product Training Procedure related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateProductTrainingProcedure" id="99a23dad-3d00-46e3-8e4f-4b17f57300b9">
              <documentation>Update work tasks and activity details for the Product Training Procedure </documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyProductTrainingProcedure" id="98daaf42-d88c-4844-a584-e84160388ece">
              <documentation>Subscribe to Product Training Procedure notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Product Quality Assurance" id="7c96c7dc-22b3-4e14-8260-30fb66756c97">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Product Quality Assurance" id="92197a91-9e5c-466a-abd8-cb20042ceca2">
              <documentation>Example of use:

A selection of response times and results are defined and applied to the sales and servicing support center for a newly launched product to determine if various performance goals are being achieved. Staff product specific training is adjusted and applied to address identified shortfalls

General comment:

This is the maintenance and execution of ongoing product and service quality assurance. It does not cover root cause analysis or procedural assurance/audit tasks nor customer surveys and reviews. It is specific (sample based) testing to ensure product and services are delivered to the prescribed performance levels and provides direct feedback to product specific training, operational support and product development capabilities

Business Purpose
:  Maintain and execute a portfolio of product quality assurance tests and if appropriate certifications. These tests can be applied to any specific aspects of product sales, servicing and fulfillment as might be appropriate






Пример использования:

Выбор времени отклика и результатов определяется и применяется к центру поддержки продаж и обслуживания для недавно запущенного продукта, чтобы определить, достигаются ли различные цели производительности. Обучение персонала по конкретным продуктам корректируется и применяется для устранения выявленных недостатков

Общее замечание:

Это обслуживание и исполнение продолжающийся обеспечения качества продукта и обслуживания. Он не охватывает анализ основных причин или процедурные задачи обеспечения/аудита, а также опросы и обзоры клиентов. Это специфическое (на основе выборки) тестирование, чтобы гарантировать, что продукт и услуги поставляются на предписанные уровни производительности и обеспечивает прямую обратную связь с продуктом конкретного обучения, оперативной поддержки и возможностей разработки продукта

деловая цель
: Ведение и выполнение портфеля тестов по обеспечению качества продукции и, при необходимости, сертификаций. Эти тесты могут быть применены к любым конкретным аспектам продажи, обслуживания и выполнения продукта, которые могут быть целесообразными</documentation>
            </element>
