              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the General Market Research Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestGeneralMarketResearchProcedure" id="22698b57-1e62-489e-849b-22c2c9187517">
              <documentation>Comment:

Request a service under the General Market Research Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveGeneralMarketResearchProcedure" id="c3eee1b0-c267-4b41-8834-b9f6585a794c">
              <documentation>Retrieve General Market Research Procedure related reports</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="updateGeneralMarketResearchProcedure" id="5c78745e-c787-4f64-8a24-f8ec2ed814f9">
              <documentation>Update work tasks and activity details for the General Market Research Procedure</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyGeneralMarketResearchProcedure" id="1b72b707-ce1b-4b53-8828-175dc3b4c16f">
              <documentation>Subscribe to General Market Research Procedure notification services</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Market Analysis" id="6e31010b-e755-457c-a6b3-94d633794c8c">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Market Analysis" id="db1a4702-9569-43c0-8ef0-9555e7510774">
              <documentation>Example of use:

Market analysts, define and develop insights into the market to support different aspects of the banks business 

General comment:

This service domain supports the range of market research analysis needed to support business management decisions. It draws on external market research and internally generated business information as necessary. It is used to develop insights into market trends and potential and to evaluate key events that might impact business directly or that of important customers and customer segments

Business Purpose
:  Analyze internal and external market information sources as necessary to develop specific market insights








Пример использования:

Аналитики рынка, определяют и развивают понимание рынка для поддержки различных аспектов бизнеса банков 

Общее замечание:

Эта область услуг поддерживает ряд исследований рынка, необходимых для поддержки решений по управлению бизнесом. Он опирается на исследования внешних рынков и, при необходимости, на внутреннюю деловую информацию. Он используется для анализа рыночных тенденций и потенциала, а также для оценки ключевых событий, которые могут повлиять на бизнес напрямую или важных клиентов и клиентских сегментов

деловая цель
: Анализ внутренних и внешних источников рыночной информации по мере необходимости для разработки конкретных рыночных идей


Market Analysis
This service domain supports the broad range of market analysis needed to support business management decisions across the bank. It draws on external market research and internally generated business information as necessary. It is used to develop insights into market trends and potential opportunities/threats. It may also be used to evaluate key events that might impact the bank's business directly or that of important customers and customer segments. A standard set of analytical views can be defined that are maintained. Furthermore the service domain may provide ad-hoc/customized analysis services

Detailed Summary
This service domain analyzes internal and external market information sources as necessary to develop specific market insights. It may maintain a collection of predefined market analyses and may also offer specific ad-hoc analysis on request

Executive Summary
This service domain analyzes internal and external market information sources as necessary to develop specific market insights. It may maintain a collection of predefined market analyses and may also offer specific ad-hoc analysis on request

Examples Of Use
External market research is used to develop competitor analysis for bank products as input to a prospect campaign development


</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="b212eb86-8a4d-40d9-8cdd-33213b78b1b3">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the General Market Research Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="0ea8714c-9a3f-414c-b860-34afccf69d04">
              <documentation>Comment:

Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the General Market Research Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="746f2a49-0606-4710-b1ad-cd2d4510e7cc">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the General Market Research Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="2c94a25e-96c0-4fc7-abc5-edf018c0c32d">
              <documentation>Request a service under the General Market Research Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="25161fa7-b90c-4fb5-a3e8-6421784f42e9">
              <documentation>Subscribe to General Market Research Analysis notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveGeneralMarketResearchAnalysis" id="31b39104-5fce-4c7b-8a34-a506452dd0ba">
              <documentation>Comment:

Retrieve General Market Research Analysis related reports</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="Contribution Analysis" id="2e7fc650-a218-4688-a257-15844f933844">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Contribution Analysis" id="c5fd714e-1369-4c47-92fd-dd62c3fb8f1c">
              <documentation>Example of use:

Business development managers used contribution analysis to identify underperforming products/customers where additional business could be generated through increased sales, usage or pricing

General comment:

This service domain is responsible for supporting contribution analysis across the customer base and identifying business improvement opportunities

Business Purpose
:  Execute contribution analysis across customer/product activity to expose business development opportunities






Пример использования:

Менеджеры по развитию бизнеса использовали анализ вклада для выявления неэффективных продуктов / клиентов, где дополнительный бизнес может быть создан за счет увеличения продаж, использования или ценообразования

Общее замечание:

Эта область обслуживания отвечает за поддержку анализа вклада по всей клиентской базе и определение возможностей улучшения бизнеса

деловая цель
: Выполнение анализа вклада в деятельность клиента / продукта для предоставления возможностей развития бизнеса
</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateContributionAnalysis" id="3f7a78cb-9285-40f7-9f78-7eabd3e35095">
              <documentation>Assign responsibility for the Contribution Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureContributionAnalysis" id="1ea947a3-f8e8-4c47-9f46-04a93e784ce5">
              <documentation>Comment:

Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the Contribution Analysis</documentation>
            </element>
