              <documentation>Terminate all or some part of the Voice Channel Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
          </folder>
          <folder name="ATM Network Management" id="cc83fb54-8e69-4661-a8b6-8bb75eb95721">
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="ATM Network Management" id="6abc1bf8-043e-4f7b-a590-9a0556ca3a2f">
              <documentation>Example of use:

A new set of standalone ATM's is installed at an airport and configured with limited services to ensure high availability for cash dispensing

General comment:

This function determines and manages the product/service availability across the ATM network and coordinates secure access administration for customers

Business Purpose
:  Configure the allocation of products and services across the ATM network and oversee ATM access registration &amp; controls






Пример использования:

Новый набор автономных банкоматов установлен в аэропорту и настроен с ограниченными услугами для обеспечения высокой доступности для выдачи наличных денег

Общее замечание:

Эта функция определяет и управляет доступностью продукта/услуги по сети ATM и координирует администрирование безопасного доступа для клиентов

деловая цель
: Настройка распределения продуктов и услуг по сети ATM и контроль за регистрацией и контролем доступа ATM</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="activateATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="44050ad6-169b-4451-9f0d-9b2bd9c7dcc7">
              <documentation>Comment:

Assign responsibility for the ATM Network Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="configureATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="ed1f6b51-a238-4076-9dfc-e39949a3fef0">
              <documentation>Amend the configuration arrangements/parameters governing the ATM Network Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="requestATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="72cfd4b5-337d-45c3-b672-426b3c16295b">
              <documentation>Request a service under the ATM Network Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="recordATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="145ba3df-061a-4c6e-8c0f-7dd095f06875">
              <documentation>Record activity details/information against the ATM Network Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="terminateATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="44e45a93-97ed-405f-a803-cba2149aeacf">
              <documentation>Comment:

Terminate all or some part of the ATM Network Management Plan</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="notifyATMNetworkManagementPlan" id="7a14875b-6b63-4174-b132-99219a8e9f59">
              <documentation>Subscribe to ATM Network Management Plan notification services</documentation>
            </element>
