Subscribe to Marketing &amp; Sales Strategy notification services</documentation>
            </element>
            <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="retrieveMarketing&amp;SalesStrategy" id="5ec1315c-2e1c-40c2-ae62-b4e53e3e9f33">
